OL,3,GNEWSAMan takes over music venue where
OL,4,Ahe had wedding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA live music promoter has become
OL,7,Fco-owner of the venue where he
OL,8,Fcelebrated his wedding and had his
OL,9,Ffirst dance.
OL,11,FLuke and Rachel Hinton married at St
OL,12,FAlbans Register Office before heading
OL,13,Fto nearby venue, The Horn, where they
OL,14,Fcut their wedding cake in the bar and
OL,15,Ftook to the live music room for their
OL,16,Ffirst dance.
OL,18,FThe 46-year-old couple, who have
OL,19,Fpromoted shows at the venue for about
OL,20,F18 years, are now running it with
OL,21,Fformer general manager Shane Smith and
OL,22,Fhis partner, Abbie Whitrow.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,373,370,200,160,0,100
